From: Guardianaifr <moneymagic393@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 01:19:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Implement Mega Senior Audit security remediations

- Add MCP threat scanner (technocore_scan)
- Fix Windows os.fchmod and fcntl crashes
- Mask IPv6 to /64 in rate limiter to prevent bypasses
- Add lock to OrderedDict _buckets to prevent thread-pool corruption
- Fix asymmetric state normalization in duplicate filter
- Add lock to reaper TTL check to prevent I/O thundering herd
